## Serverless Deployment

<% if (cloudProvider === 'aws') { %>
### AWS Lambda + API Gateway

```bash
# Install AWS SAM CLI
pip install aws-sam-cli

# Build
sam build

# Deploy
sam deploy --guided
```

**Resources Created**:
- Lambda functions
- API Gateway
- CloudWatch Logs
- IAM roles

<% } else if (cloudProvider === 'gcp') { %>
### Google Cloud Functions

```bash
# Deploy function
gcloud functions deploy <%= projectName %> \
  --gen2 \
  --runtime python311 \
  --trigger-http \
  --allow-unauthenticated \
  --region us-central1
```

<% } else if (cloudProvider === 'azure') { %>
### Azure Functions

```bash
# Create function app
az functionapp create \
  --resource-group <%= projectName %>-rg \
  --name <%= projectName %>-func \
  --storage-account <%= projectName %>storage \
  --runtime python \
  --runtime-version 3.11

# Deploy
func azure functionapp publish <%= projectName %>-func
```
<% } %>

<% } else { %>
## Container Deployment

### Build Docker Image

```bash
# Build production image
docker build -t <%= projectName %>:latest .

# Test locally
docker run -p 8000:8000 <%= projectName %>:latest
```

### Push to Registry

<% if (cloudProvider === 'aws') { %>
```bash
# AWS ECR
aws ecr get-login-password --region us-east-1 | \
  docker login --username AWS --password-stdin ACCOUNT.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com

docker tag <%= projectName %>:latest ACCOUNT.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/<%= projectName %>:latest
docker push ACCOUNT.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/<%= projectName %>:latest
```
<% } else if (cloudProvider === 'gcp') { %>
```bash
# GCP Container Registry
docker tag <%= projectName %>:latest gcr.io/PROJECT-ID/<%= projectName %>:latest
docker push gcr.io/PROJECT-ID/<%= projectName %>:latest
```
<% } else { %>
```bash
# Docker Hub
docker tag <%= projectName %>:latest yourusername/<%= projectName %>:latest
docker push yourusername/<%= projectName %>:latest
```
<% } %>

### Deploy to Kubernetes

```bash
# Apply manifests
kubectl apply -f infrastructure/kubernetes/

# Check deployment
kubectl get pods
kubectl logs -f deployment/<%= projectName %>

# Expose service
kubectl port-forward service/<%= projectName %> 8000:8000
```

<% if (cloudProvider === 'aws') { %>
### Deploy to AWS ECS

```bash
# Create cluster
aws ecs create-cluster --cluster-name <%= projectName %>-cluster

# Register task definition
aws ecs register-task-definition --cli-input-json file://task-definition.json

# Create service
aws ecs create-service \
  --cluster <%= projectName %>-cluster \
  --service-name <%= projectName %>-service \
  --task-definition <%= projectName %>-task \
  --desired-count 2 \
  --launch-type FARGATE
```
<% } else if (cloudProvider === 'gcp') { %>
### Deploy to Cloud Run

```bash
gcloud run deploy <%= projectName %> \
  --image gcr.io/PROJECT-ID/<%= projectName %>:latest \
  --platform managed \
  --region us-central1 \
  --allow-unauthenticated \
  --memory 512Mi
```
<% } %>
<% } %>

## Environment Configuration

